Z||000000||helmet1978||11-11-2001||04:54 PM||||Hello everyone!<P>Since there doesn't appear to be a forum for new member intros I guess I'll just drop it in here  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>My name is Paul Heindselman and I currently have 2 86 Fiero SE 2M6's with 4 speeds. One red, one black.<P>Got my red car in 96 when I was a senior in high school. It now has a rebuilt 2.8L V6, Fiero Store KYB suspension kit (shocks, springs, swaybars), Fiero Store crossdrilled brake kit, Borla exhaust and a bunch of other stuff.<P>I've had the black car for about 2 years. Still stock.<P>I am a member of the Southwest Idaho Fiero Club based in Boise, Idaho and also run the club website at <A HREF="http://www.raceme.cc/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://www.raceme.cc/fiero</A> <P>Its great to see the Fiero community has this forum as a resource...much better than the old Fiero Mailing list that I was on back in 96!<P>Hopefully I can be of some help around here and its good to see so many Fiero people again<P>------------------<BR>Paul Heindselman<BR>Southwest Idaho Fiero Club<BR>1986 Fiero SE 2M6 - Red<BR>1986 Fiero SE 2M6 - Black (For Sale)<BR>2000 Grand Am GT Sedan - White||||reg||1
